		{
			dependencies: ["09EEADB48E883801"]
			description: [
				"The &5End Dimension&r in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r has been redesigned to provide a more engaging and expansive progression experience. Its terrain now features enhanced island structures, new verticality, and unique generation patterns that support exploration and late-game resource acquisition."
				""
				"The End is no longer a simple conclusion—it serves as a substantial progression tier with new systems, challenges, and opportunities."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Battle for Destiny&r"
				"The encounter with the &eEnder Dragon&r has been updated to introduce new attack patterns, improved behavior, and a more challenging combat sequence. Proper equipment, careful planning, and effective strategy are essential to completing this fight."
				""
				"Defeating the dragon unlocks additional pathways for progression and grants access to advanced materials and exploration areas within the dimension."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBeyond the Portal Lies Opportunity&r"
				"After the dragon is defeated, the End islands provide further exploration potential. These regions contain unique materials, additional structures, and resources required for endgame crafting and technological advancement."
				""
				"Progressing through the End encourages continued exploration while preparing you for higher-tier objectives."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAdvancing Through the Endgame&r"
				"The redesigned End functions as both a testing ground and a launch point for your final progression stages. Overcoming its challenges enables access to specialized crafting chains, enhanced gear, and dimensional content required for the most advanced goals in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"This is not the end of your journey—it is the route forward into your late-game objectives."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/end_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the End in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Dedicated Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"7964AB0D39902EFA\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:end_stone"
			id: "58F4190183C467EE"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "1AECA3DBC6993A37"
					item: "minecraft:dragon_egg"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "6B4409CC18096647"
