		{
			dependencies: ["090A156A3CB027A3"]
			description: [
				"In &5Create - Forge Frontier&r, &5End Remastered&r has been completely reforged into a bold new adventure-transforming every element of the beloved mod into a uniquely crafted journey.  "
				"From reimagined Eye recipes to enhanced lore and mechanics, every piece has been meticulously redesigned to challenge your ingenuity and captivate your spirit of discovery."
				""
				"The road to the End is no longer a simple search for strongholds-it is an expedition demanding courage, exploration, and mastery of custom-crafted relics."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lFifteen Eyes, Fifteen Legends&r  "
				"To awaken the End Portal, you must gather &e15 unique Ender Eyes&r, each with its own story, lore, and hidden trials.  "
				"Crafting each Eye requires venturing into dangerous biomes, overcoming powerful foes, and unlocking creative new crafting techniques."
				""
				"Every Eye tells a tale-adding depth, mystery, and rich progression to your quest for the End.  "
				"Prepare for a journey where each discovery is a victory, and each crafted Eye is a chapter of your legend."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Portal Reborn&r  "
				"Strongholds have been transformed, their ancient halls reshaped to reflect your epic journey.  "
				"New mechanics and revamped layouts ensure that no two adventures will ever feel the same.  "
				"The path to the End Portal is now an achievement to be earned-a testament to your perseverance, wit, and bravery."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lRise to the Endgame&r  "
				"The Forge Frontier edition of End Remastered is not just an overhaul-it is a celebration of the journey itself.  "
				"Gather your strength. Forge your destiny.  "
				"Step boldly toward an Endgame adventure unlike anything you’ve faced before."
				""
				"The path awaits-&nwill you rise to the occasion?&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/endframe_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about End Remastered in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Dedicated Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55E1F170D9933E8F\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:end_portal_frame"
