		{
			dependencies: ["58F4190183C467EE"]
			description: [
				"The &6Tier 5 Rocket&r serves as a major late-game milestone within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. This advanced spacecraft is exclusive to the pack and represents the next significant step in interplanetary progression. Constructing it requires materials sourced from the End Dimension, alongside specialized components obtained throughout your earlier exploration tiers."
				""
				"Reaching this stage indicates mastery of key systems, including resource automation, combat readiness, and multi-dimensional navigation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Gateway to Alien Worlds&r"
				"With the Tier 5 Rocket, you gain access to the &bAlex’s Caves Biome Planets&r—unique worlds featuring specialized biomes, rare materials, and new exploration challenges. These planets include underground forests, crystalline caverns, and other environments designed to expand your late-game resource pool and progression options."
				""
				"Each destination provides new opportunities for gathering advanced materials required for higher tiers of engineering and exploration."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Late-Game Milestone&r"
				"The Tier 5 Rocket functions as both a technological achievement and a progression gateway. Its construction demonstrates your advancement across multiple dimensions and systems while granting access to the rarest resources available in the pack."
				""
				"Use this rocket to push deeper into late-game exploration, secure specialized materials, and continue developing the infrastructure needed for future objectives."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/tier_5.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Tier 5 Rocket in its  "
