		{
			dependencies: ["2E5C57802F26496D"]
			description: [
				"The &6Forge Rocket&r represents the highest tier of engineering within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. It is a custom-designed spacecraft that draws upon materials, mechanics, and systems found throughout the entire modpack. Constructing it signifies a major late-game milestone and reflects mastery over automation, dimensional progression, and resource refinement."
				""
				"Every component of the Forge Rocket requires advanced infrastructure, efficient material processing, and integration of multiple modded systems."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Gateway to New Frontiers&r"
				"The Forge Rocket is designed to access &6The Forge&r—a future endgame destination planned to introduce new challenges, rare resources, and high-tier progression content. While this world is not yet available, preparing the rocket establishes the foundation for upcoming expansions and future objectives."
				""
				"Building the Forge Rocket ensures that your late-game infrastructure is ready for the next phase of exploration."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPrepare for Greatness&r"
				""
				"- Acquire rare materials from the Overworld, Nether, and End Dimensions."
				"- Utilize advanced automation and processing systems powered by &eCreate&r and its addon ecosystem."
				"- Assemble the Forge Rocket using high-tier components crafted from late-game materials and multi-stage production chains."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Defining Milestone&r"
				"The Forge Rocket serves as both a technical achievement and a symbol of progression. Completing it demonstrates your ability to manage complex resource systems, refine high-tier components, and integrate a broad range of mechanics."
				""
				"Construct the rocket, prepare your equipment, and set the stage for future exploration as new content becomes available."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/forge_rocket.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Forge Rocket in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Dedicated Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"262FF2B00E853521\" } }"
			]
			id: "7F95771279F2C700"
