		}
		{
			description: [
				"Your adventure begins in the &aOverworld&r, a diverse and resource-rich environment filled with custom biomes, ancient structures, and new opportunities for progression. As you establish your footing, you will uncover the path to &cNether Remastered&r, where a set of unique Overworld artifacts unlocks access to a challenging dimension shaped by heat, danger, and valuable materials."
				""
				"Each milestone expands your capabilities and prepares you for the worlds ahead."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lJourney Beyond the Sky&r"
				"Once you construct your first &eTier 1 Rocket&r, interplanetary travel becomes possible. The &6Ad Astra&r system introduces a range of planets, each with distinct hazards, environmental mechanics, and rare resources essential for advanced crafting and engineering."
				""
				"Further progression leads you to confront the &9Warden&r and secure access to the &5Otherside&r, a spectral dimension housing powerful materials and late-game progression routes."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lConquer the End and Advance Further&r"
				"The redesigned &5End Remastered&r presents new progression mechanics and a more strategic Dragon Fight. Navigate altered terrain, uncover hidden structures, and obtain specialized materials that enable critical late-game technologies."
				""
				"With the rewards gathered here, you can construct the &eTier 5 Rocket&r and journey into &bAlex’s Caves&r, where each world features unique biomes, environmental challenges, and specialized resources required for high-tier advancement."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lForge Your Ultimate Legacy&r"
				"Your final major objective is the construction of the &6Forge Rocket&r, a culmination of everything you have achieved so far. This advanced vessel grants access to the &6Forge Planet&r, a specialized endgame world designed to test your engineering, resource management, and exploration skills."
				""
				"This destination serves as the launch point for future expansions, greater challenges, and long-term mastery of the pack."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&nYour journey continues from here.&r"
				"Explore every dimension. Push deeper into progression.  "
				"Forge your legacy across worlds and rise to meet the frontier ahead."
			]
